				"description": "`creator`, `hashtag`, `sound` and `keyword` only: each cycle judges the Sample's Videos (a Creator's new Videos, and any of its newest 20 not yet judged under this Focus) in focus, off focus or unjudged, and `GET /v1/trackers/{id}` hides the off-focus ones. A Video's caption, hashtags and any analysis transcript count, so spoken mentions do too. Sample stats and Snapshots are unchanged. +3 credits per Video the model judges, +1 credit per Video `must_mention` rules out, nothing for a Video already judged under the same Focus (shared across your Trackers) or one that could not be judged; `estimate` adds a full Sample (a Creator: its newest 20 Videos) judged. On a target you already track, a different Focus is not applied: the Tracker comes back unchanged and uncharged with `focus_applied: false` and a `focus_note` pointing to `PUT /v1/trackers/{id}/focus`; leaving `focus` out never clears one. Another kind is refused with 422 `focus_unsupported_kind`; a malformed Focus with 400 `invalid_request`."
